<title>SWEDEN: Trelleborg says Boliden news later today.</title>
<headline>Trelleborg says Boliden news later today.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish metals and mining group Trelleborg said on Monday its unit Boliden would make some sort of announcement to the market in a couple of hours.</p>
<p>&quot;(Boliden) will release information to the market about Boliden in one or two hours,&quot; Trelleborg spokesman Leif Oberg told Reuters.</p>
<p>Earlier in January shares in Trelleborg soared on market rumours that the company would spin off Boliden.</p>
<p>-- Jorgen Osterberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1008</p>
